// Hidden input whose value comes from the visitor's session, put there by code that redirected to the page
// (a Jahia action, a servlet): the value never travels in the URL nor in a cookie.
// The page is served from the fragment cache, so the value is asked for by the browser, not rendered.
[fmdb:inputHiddenPrefilled] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:element, fmdbmix:submittableField, fmdbmix:profileMappableField
 - prefillKey (string) mandatory indexed=no
 - value (string) indexed=no
